---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="How Goods Desk earns money, and what that does and does not affect."
>
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-top:3rem">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="lede">{SITE.disclosureShort}</p>

    <h2>What this means</h2>
    <p>
      Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click one and buy something, the
      retailer pays us a small commission. The price you pay is exactly the same either way, and
      the commission comes out of the retailer's margin, not your pocket.
    </p>

    <h2>Amazon Associates</h2>
    <p>{SITE.amazonDisclosure}</p>

    <h2>What it does not affect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Which products we recommend, and in what order.</li>
      <li>What we say about a product's weaknesses.</li>
      <li>Whether we tell you that the cheaper option is good enough.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We do not accept payment from manufacturers or brands in exchange for coverage, a
      recommendation, or a particular ranking. We do not publish sponsored posts written by
      someone else.
    </p>

    <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
    <p>
      Prices and availability shown on this site are accurate as of the time of publication or
      last update, and are subject to change. The price shown at the retailer at the time of
      purchase is the one that applies.
    </p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> if anything here is
      unclear.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
